      "With your leadership pipeline forged and succession secured, you must now establish the quantitative compass that guides executive decision-making across the enterprise. In the following chapter, we will master the art of measuring what matters, separating deceptive lagging indicators from actionable leading metrics that predict commercial victory. With succession secured, you must now install the diagnostic instrumentation that tracks enterprise momentum through leading and lagging metrics."
